      "text": "Rio de Janeiro has long been one of Latin America’s most welcoming cities for LGBTQIA+ travellers. You can pair the city’s classic sights with a more personal look at Rio: the beaches of Ipanema and Copacabana, cocktail bars, nightlife, music and dancing, and an atmosphere where you can feel free to be yourself.",
